# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# MSL .gitignore
#
# Policy (see research/DATA.md):
#   • Code, configs, and docs are tracked.
#   • Raw research data (HDF5/NPZ/pickles, run directories) stays local-only.
#   • A curated set of small key-result files is tracked via explicit
#     `git add -f`; the full list lives in research/DATA.md.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Local-only archive (superseded working copies; never committed)
/_local/

# Rust build artifacts
/target/
rust-core/target/
rust-python/target/
rust-wasm/target/

# Python
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.so
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
rust-python/.python-version
rust-python/dist/
rust-python/build/

# Media files (final figures live in the thesis repo; web assets whitelisted below)
*.png
*.gif
*.mp4
research/post_thesis/**/*.pdf

# Binary research data — local only, curated exceptions force-added (research/DATA.md)
*.hdf5
*.h5
*.npz
*.pkl
*.ckpt

# Raw pipeline run directories — local only (metadata/summaries force-added)
research/moire_envelope/runsV3/
research/moire_envelope/_archive/runs_v1/
research/moire_envelope/_archive/runsV2/

# Large validation-study output directories (code at their top level stays tracked)
research/moire_envelope/thesis_results/T_direct_validation/*/
research/moire_envelope/thesis_results/T_convergence/*/
research/moire_envelope/thesis_results/T_monolayer_limit/*/
research/studies/fdfd_convergence/data*/

# WASM generated files
rust-wasm/pkg/
rust-wasm/pkg-node/
rust-wasm/pkg-bundler/

# Web/Node.js
web/node_modules/
web/.next/
web/out/
web/.env*.local
web/*.log

# IDE and editor files
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# OS generated files
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db

# Logs
*.log
nohup.out
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Documentation build artifacts
docs/_build/
docs/.doctrees/

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp

# Allow media files for the website's public folder
!web/public/**/*.png
!web/public/**/*.gif
